WEBVTT

00:02:56.663 --> 00:03:00.329
Do te cuditeni se si ajri i paster frymezon mendim te paster,

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:01.913
dhe ne kete menyre,

00:03:01.913 --> 00:03:05.454
do te sillni ne jeten tuaj nje grup ideshe plotesisht te reja.

00:03:05.454 --> 00:03:07.163
Faleminderit.

00:03:07.163 --> 00:03:11.413
(Duartrokitje)